direction: down
old: "Current coupled responsibilities\nC scanner creates checks / roots / resume labels\nimplicit native root and cleanup authority"
new: "New authorities\nScheme completion + generated native products\nexplicit registry / store / release contracts"
old -> new: "extract semantics; rebuild actual callers"
gate: "Retirement gate\nall selected producers / readers / bootstrap users\ncontrol, roots, module and last-user evidence"
new -> gate
delete: "Delete zero-caller old paths\nsemantic C-emission inference\nold cohort module / label discovery\nopaque root / wait / destruction authority"
retain: "Retain deliberate native C code\ncollector and continuation algorithms\nC ABI / RC storage / TLS / OS leaves\nother separately admitted C cohorts"
gate -> delete: "complete replacement"
gate -> retain: "valid remaining responsibilities"
llvm: "Optional LLVM / MLIR cohort\nbypasses its C emission / C frontend\nadds provider and runtime acceptance work"
gate -> llvm: "independent provider gate"
